Keep tools({ callToolTimeoutMs }) scoped to bound tool execution. Delegate
ordinary, modern and input-resume calls to upstream requestOptions; carry the
same timeout through task poll/result/cancellation without an aborted signal
on cancellation. Discovery retains its independently configured timeout.
Regression: apps/api/src/lib/mcp-upstream/tanstack-ai-mcp-timeout.test.ts.

